<http://www.semanticweb.org/ontologies/2009/3/ontoDPN.owl#ObjetAbstrait> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "Menelas definition :\n\"An abstract object is defined as a substratum for which one can say it has instances or occurrences in a universe. While there is only one number 2, there are many apples. Hence, 2 is not abstract, while an apple is. \"\n\nCG Representation : [abstract_object: _x]" .
